</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Effects of vehicles on baseline-corrected QTc in the anaesthetized guinea pig</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="left"/><col align="char" char="&#x000b1;"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Vehicles</italic></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Composition</italic></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50"><italic>Baseline-corrected QTc (&#x00394;&#x00025;)(</italic>n<italic>)</italic></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">0.9&#x00025; NaCl</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">1.3&#x000b1;0.8 (5)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">2</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">15&#x00025; HP-&#x003b2;-cyclodextrin in 25&#x02009;m<sc>M</sc> methanesulphonic acid</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">1.5&#x000b1;0.1 (5)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">3</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">5&#x00025; DMSO&#x02013;10&#x00025; SBE&#x02013;cyclodextrin in 5&#x02009;m<sc>M</sc> methanesulphonic acid</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">1.6&#x000b1;0.8 (5)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">4</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">10&#x02009;mg&#x02009;mL<sup>&#x02212;1</sup> lactic acid in 5&#x00025; dextrose in water</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">0.4&#x000b1;1.2 (5)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t4-fn1"><label/><p>Abbreviation: QTc, heart rate corrected QT interval of the ECG.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>